+		Title: "Set the cache pin mode for a file or directory.",
+		Help: strings.ReplaceAll(`
+
+Pinned paths are never evicted by the cache cleaner. A pin on a
+directory applies to everything below it unless overridden.
+
+This takes the following parameters
+
+- |path| - file or directory, relative to the VFS root
+- |paths| - list of paths, instead of |path|
+- |mode| - |pinned| to keep it cached, or |unpinned| to remove the pin
+  (stored as an exception if a parent directory is pinned)
+
+Pinning is all or nothing: if the files not yet cached would not fit in
